Package: streamStats
Title: Memory-Efficient Online Statistical Accumulator via Rcpp
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(Taruna Dagur , tardagur@gmail.com, role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a high-performance, object-oriented streaming data 
    accumulator using Welford's algorithm and Algorithm R reservoir sampling. 
    The package computes running statistical metrics—including mean, variance, 
    standard deviation, minimum, maximum, and tracking samples—incrementally 
    without storing historical points in memory, providing bulletproof 
    numerical stability against catastrophic cancellation.
